uture declarations of dividends and the establishment of future record and payment dates are subject to the final determination and discretion of our Board. Senior Secured Notes On October 1, 2026, the Company issued $500 million in aggregate principal amount of 6.70% senior secured notes due 2031 (Senior Secured Notes 2031) and $500 million in aggregate principal amount of 7.15% senior secured notes due 2033 (Senior Secured Notes 2033) in an unregistered offering to qualified institutional buyers pursuant to Rule 144A under the Securities Act and to certain non-U.S. persons in offshore transactions pursuant to Regulation S under the Securities Act. The Senior Secured Notes 2031 and the Senior Secured Notes 2033 bear interest at rates of 6.70% and 7.15% per annum, respectively, payable semi-annually in arrears on April 15 and October 15 of each year, commencing on April 15, 2027. The Senior Secured Notes 2031 and the Senior Secured Notes 2033 will mature on October 15, 2031 and October 15, 2033, respectively, unless earlier redeemed,\n"}
